<title>USA: Bausch &amp; Lomb Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Bausch &amp; Lomb Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.06		    $0.39</p>
<p> Net		 3,300		    22,500</p>
<p> Revs		451,200		  469,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  55,615		   57,108</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE:  1996 sales included $14.9 million in first quarter revenues from the divested oral care and dental implant businesses.</p>
<p>Restructuring charges reduced first quarter 1997 net earnings by $7.7 million or $0.14 per share.</p>
<p>Net earnings includes a provision of $6.8 million or $0.12 per share after taxes for the expected cost of discontinuing certain product lines and writing off other investments in the eyewear segment.</p>
<p>Actual outstanding shares at 03/29/97 were 55,527.</p>
</text>
